<title>USA: Waunakee, Wis., $1.055 mln won by Bernardi Sec..</title>
<headline>Waunakee, Wis., $1.055 mln won by Bernardi Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Sec. said it won $1.055 million of Wauankee, Wis., sewerage system revenue bonds, Sseries 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.4204 percent.</p>
</text>
